# ── Secret config files — NEVER commit these ──────────────────────────────────
# appsettings.json            → base config, safe to commit (no secrets)
# appsettings.Staging.json    → structural staging config, safe to commit (no secrets)
# appsettings.example.json    → template, safe to commit (no real values)
# Everything below is gitignored because it contains real credentials:
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

# ── Upload files — never commit user-uploaded content ─────────────────────────
/NGOConnect.API/UploadFiles/
UploadFiles/
